---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="订阅 · 虾兵xie讲" activeNav="/subscribe">
  <article class="subscribe-page">
    <nav class="post-back">
      <a href="/">← 返回首页</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="subscribe-header">
      <h1>订阅</h1>
      <p class="subscribe-lead">选择一种方式，不错过更新。</p>
    </header>

    <div class="subscribe-list">
      <div class="subscribe-item">
        <div class="subscribe-item-header">
          <h2>RSS</h2>
          <span class="subscribe-status">可用</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subscribe-desc">用 RSS 阅读器订阅，文章发布后自动推送。推荐 NetNewsWire（macOS）、Feedly、Inoreader。</p>
        <div class="subscribe-action">
          <a href="/rss.xml" class="subscribe-link">/rss.xml →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subscribe-item">
        <div class="subscribe-item-header">
          <h2>GitHub</h2>
          <span class="subscribe-status">可用</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subscribe-desc">在 GitHub 上 Watch 本仓库，每次推送代码都会收到通知。适合开发者。</p>
        <div class="subscribe-action">
          <a href="https://github.com/xierenhao/myblog" class="subscribe-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/xierenhao/myblog →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="subscribe-item">
        <div class="subscribe-item-header">
          <h2>邮箱订阅</h2>
          <span class="subscribe-status-soon">即将开放</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subscribe-desc">留下邮箱，新文章发布时收到一封邮件。目前正在评估服务方案。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .subscribe-page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 32px 0 64px;
  }

  .post-back {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .post-back a {
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }

  .post-back a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .subscribe-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .subscribe-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subscribe-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .subscribe-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .subscribe-item {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .subscribe-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .subscribe-item-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subscribe-item-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .subscribe-status {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .subscribe-status-soon {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .subscribe-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .subscribe-link {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--line);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s;
  }

  .subscribe-link:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
